\title{stepwedgepower: Simulation-Based Power Evaluation for Stepped-Wedge Trials}
\description{
Provides design objects, binary-outcome data generation, mixed-model
analysis, simulation-based power and type I error evaluation, sensitivity
grids, and validation tools for stepped-wedge cluster randomized trials.
The package also supports asynchronous cumulative-intervention schedules in
which clusters transition from Control to A and later add B at different
calendar times, with delayed effects, multiplicity-aware contrasts, and
failure-aware operating characteristics.
